<title>SPAIN: Spain's SEPI named coordinators for Repsol sale.</title>
<headline>Spain's SEPI named coordinators for Repsol sale.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's State holding agency SEPA named on Friday BBV interactivos, Banco Santander Investment and Goldman Sachs as global coordinators for the sale of its remaining 10 percent in Repsol.</p>
<p>A statesment added that SEPI expects to start the selling of the Repsol's stake, as soon as it will end the privatisation of Telefonica expected to be in January, February 1997.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
